    "The heater heats the spa while the spa filter runs, and otherwise the pool while the filter runs in Pool or Spillover flow. Once that water reaches its setpoint it stops, and starts again when the water cools below it." : {

    },
    "The kinds of event read again from their stored frames; the others stay as they are. Communication errors hold the frames the server couldn’t read. Readings and equipment also lose repeats of a value the server once stored again." : {

    },
    "The network is an address and prefix, like 192.168.1.0/24." : {

    },
